    "body": "Hi all!\r\n\r\nI noticed that even when the setting:\r\n\r\nAdmin > Configuration > General > Allow users to disable announcements\r\n\r\nis unchecked (set to OFF), at the bottom of notification email users still see this message:\r\n\r\n> To unsubscribe from these announcements, login to the forum and uncheck \"Receive forum announcements and important notifications by email.\" in your profile.\r\n\r\nBecause users cannot change this setting (as it was disabled via Admin) this part of notification should be removed.",
